{"video_id":"jgy-014","points":[{"kp_id":"jgy-014.kp0001","video_id":"jgy-014","type":"clinical_tip","statement":"金匮第十三篇论消渴、小便不利、淋病；消渴范围大于西医糖尿病，经方对二型消渴可速效。","evidence_quote":"消渴","start_s":4.74,"end_s":12.0,"confidence":0.95},{"kp_id":"jgy-014.kp0002","video_id":"jgy-014","type":"pathomechanism","statement":"中医消渴责血中缺水：口渴饮水而不能入血脉补津，故愈饮愈渴。","evidence_quote":"缺水","start_s":336.82,"end_s":346.285,"confidence":0.9},{"kp_id":"jgy-014.kp0003","video_id":"jgy-014","type":"clinical_tip","statement":"吃完宵夜即睡，食停胃中蠕动减缓，糖分释放、胃热渐增，为消渴重要成因；亦见“生活习惯遗传”。","evidence_quote":"小肠","start_s":664.89,"end_s":671.205,"confidence":0.85},{"kp_id":"jgy-014.kp0004","video_id":"jgy-014","type":"pathomechanism","statement":"内经三阳结谓之消渴：胃与大肠过热，中焦（含胆）随之热。","evidence_quote":"消渴","start_s":1077.57,"end_s":1082.42,"confidence":0.9},{"kp_id":"jgy-014.kp0005","video_id":"jgy-014","type":"clause_interpretation","statement":"厥阴消渴气上冲心、心中疼热、饥不欲食；攻下利不止，示非宿食而属厥阴消渴。","evidence_quote":"消渴","start_s":1134.39,"end_s":1147.31,"confidence":0.9},{"kp_id":"jgy-014.kp0006","video_id":"jgy-014","type":"diagnostic_rule","statement":"饥不欲食、食即吐，若大黄甘草汤后能食不吐则为宿食；利不止则病未去，属厥阴消渴。","evidence_quote":"大黄甘草汤","start_s":1186.029,"end_s":1192.909,"confidence":0.9},{"kp_id":"jgy-014.kp0007","video_id":"jgy-014","type":"formula_indication","statement":"上消口渴饮不解，上焦津伤，人参白虎汤（白虎加人参）证。","evidence_quote":"人参白虎汤","start_s":1381.849,"end_s":1384.489,"confidence":0.95},{"kp_id":"jgy-014.kp0008","video_id":"jgy-014","type":"formula_indication","statement":"下消男子消渴小便多（饮一溲一）、性功能衰，肾气丸主之。","evidence_quote":"肾气丸","start_s":1399.489,"end_s":1406.774,"confidence":0.95},{"kp_id":"jgy-014.kp0009","video_id":"jgy-014","type":"formula_indication","statement":"脉浮小便不利为热在表/水停，消渴而小便不利者五苓散。","evidence_quote":"五苓散","start_s":1456.099,"end_s":1462.769,"confidence":0.95},{"kp_id":"jgy-014.kp0010","video_id":"jgy-014","type":"formula_indication","statement":"渴欲饮水、水入则吐为水逆，亦属五苓散（如小儿吐乳）。","evidence_quote":"水逆","start_s":1497.059,"end_s":1501.934,"confidence":0.95},{"kp_id":"jgy-014.kp0011","video_id":"jgy-014","type":"diagnostic_rule","statement":"口渴同见：小便不利→五苓散；小便自利而渴不止→白虎汤。","evidence_quote":"白虎汤","start_s":1595.169,"end_s":1598.544,"confidence":0.95},{"kp_id":"jgy-014.kp0012","video_id":"jgy-014","type":"formula_composition","statement":"上消白虎加人参：石膏一两起、知母、生甘草、人参（或党参；无参可用瓜蒌根等生津）。","evidence_quote":"石膏","start_s":1631.509,"end_s":1640.169,"confidence":0.9},{"kp_id":"jgy-014.kp0013","video_id":"jgy-014","type":"clinical_tip","statement":"中消三阳结兼便秘，白虎加大黄枳实清胃肠热；血糖过高或过低致饥颤均可重用石膏白虎。","evidence_quote":"肾气丸","start_s":1878.379,"end_s":1881.199,"confidence":0.85},{"kp_id":"jgy-014.kp0014","video_id":"jgy-014","type":"clinical_tip","statement":"中医淋含膏淋、沙淋、血淋等，范围大于西医淋病/性病。","evidence_quote":"淋病","start_s":1921.039,"end_s":1921.499,"confidence":0.9},{"kp_id":"jgy-014.kp0015","video_id":"jgy-014","type":"diagnostic_rule","statement":"小便如粟状、少腹弦急痛引脐中；痛自尿道牵至脐多为膀胱结石，少腹剧痛多为输尿管结石。","evidence_quote":"膀胱","start_s":2010.779,"end_s":2027.399,"confidence":0.9}]}